  },
  {
   "text": "his character of “the Captain,” gallantly shot him through the",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 21.880555555555556,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 24.96388888888889,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "head and rode away; the mail was waylaid by seven robbers,",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 25.761111111111113,
   "x1": 192.00000000000009,
   "y1": 28.844444444444445,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and the guard shot three dead, and then got shot dead himself",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 29.64166666666667,
   "x1": 192.00000000000009,
   "y1": 32.725,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "by the other four, “in consequence of the failure of his",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 33.522222222222226,
   "x1": 191.99999999999991,
   "y1": 36.60555555555556,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "ammunition:” after which the mail was robbed in peace; that",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 37.40277777777778,
   "x1": 191.99999999999997,
   "y1": 40.486111111111114,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "magnificent potentate, the Lord Mayor of London, was made to",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 41.28333333333333,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 44.36666666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "stand and deliver on Turnham Green, by one highwayman,",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 45.163888888888884,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 48.24722222222222,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "who despoiled the illustrious creature in sight of all his",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 49.04444444444444,
   "x1": 192.00000000000009,
   "y1": 52.12777777777777,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "retinue.",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 52.92499999999999,
   "x1": 117.66666666666667,
   "y1": 56.008333333333326,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All these things, and a thousand like them, came to pass in",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 56.80555555555554,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 59.88888888888888,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and close upon the dear old year one thousand seven hundred",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 60.686111111111096,
   "x1": 191.99999999999991,
   "y1": 63.76944444444443,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and seventy-five. Environed by them, while the Woodman and",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 64.56666666666665,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 67.64999999999998,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the Farmer worked unheeded, those two of the large jaws, and",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 68.44722222222221,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 71.53055555555554,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "those other two of the plain and the fair faces, trod with stir",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 72.32777777777777,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 75.4111111111111,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "enough, and carried their divine rights with a high hand. Thus",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 76.20833333333333,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 79.29166666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "did the year one thousand seven hundred and seventy-five",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 80.08888888888889,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 83.17222222222222,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conduct their Greatnesses, and myriads of small creatures—",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 83.96944444444445,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 87.05277777777778,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the creatures of this chronicle among the rest—along the",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 87.85000000000001,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 90.93333333333334,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "roads that lay before them.",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 91.73055555555557,
   "x1": 143.5,
   "y1": 94.8138888888889,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chapter I",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 98.71555555555557,
   "x1": 124.91666666666667,
   "y1": 102.99055555555557,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": true,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 107.2527777777778,
   "x1": 191.99999999999991,
   "y1": 110.33611111111112,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a wife.",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 111.13333333333335,
   "x1": 181.25,
   "y1": 114.21666666666668,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "However little known the feelings or views of such a man",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 115.01388888888891,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 118.09722222222224,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "may be on his first entering a neighbourhood, this truth is so",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 118.89444444444447,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 121.9777777777778,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "well fixed in the minds of the surrounding families, that he is",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 122.77500000000003,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 125.85833333333336,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "considered as the rightful property of some one or other of",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 126.6555555555556,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 129.73888888888894,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "their daughters.",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 130.53611111111115,
   "x1": 128.75,
   "y1": 133.6194444444445,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“My dear Mr. Bennet,” said his lady to him one day, “have",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 134.4166666666667,
   "x1": 192.00000000000009,
   "y1": 137.50000000000006,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "you heard that Netherfield Park is let at last?”",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 138.29722222222227,
   "x1": 168.58203125,
   "y1": 141.38055555555562,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mr. Bennet replied that he had not.",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 142.17777777777783,
   "x1": 158.83333333333334,
   "y1": 145.26111111111118,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“But it is,” returned she; “for Mrs. Long has just been here,",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 146.0583333333334,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 149.14166666666674,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and she told me all about it.”",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 149.93888888888895,
   "x1": 145.25,
   "y1": 153.0222222222223,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mr. Bennet made no answer.",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 153.8194444444445,
   "x1": 150.33333333333334,
   "y1": 156.90277777777786,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Do not you want to know who has taken it?” cried his wife",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 157.70000000000007,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 160.78333333333342,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "impatiently.",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 161.58055555555563,
   "x1": 123.41666666666667,
   "y1": 164.66388888888898,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“You want to tell me, and I have no objection to hearing it.”",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 165.4611111111112,
   "x1": 190.74609375,
   "y1": 168.54444444444454,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This was invitation enough.",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 169.34166666666675,
   "x1": 149.0,
   "y1": 172.4250000000001,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Why, my dear, you must know, Mrs. Long says that",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 173.2222222222223,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 176.30555555555566,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Netherfield is taken by a young man of large fortune from the",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 177.10277777777787,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 180.18611111111122,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "north of England; that he came down on Monday in a chaise",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 180.98333333333343,
   "x1": 191.99999999999991,
   "y1": 184.06666666666678,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and four to see the place, and was so much delighted with it",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 184.863888888889,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 187.94722222222234,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "that he agreed with Mr. Morris immediately; that he is to take",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 188.74444444444455,
   "x1": 192.00000000000009,
   "y1": 191.8277777777779,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "possession before Michaelmas, and some of his servants are to",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 192.6250000000001,
   "x1": 191.99999999999997,
   "y1": 195.70833333333346,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "be in the house by the end of next week.”",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 196.50555555555567,
   "x1": 162.0,
   "y1": 199.58888888888902,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“What is his name?”",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 200.38611111111123,
   "x1": 138.58333333333334,
   "y1": 203.46944444444458,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Bingley.”",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 204.2666666666668,
   "x1": 124.91666666666667,
   "y1": 207.35000000000014,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Is he married or single?”",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 208.14722222222235,
   "x1": 145.91666666666666,
   "y1": 211.2305555555557,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Oh! single, my dear, to be sure! A single man of large for-",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 212.0277777777779,
   "x1": 191.99999999999997,
   "y1": 215.11111111111126,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "tune; four or five thousand a year. What a fine thing for our",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 215.90833333333347,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 218.99166666666682,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "girls!”",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 219.78888888888903,
   "x1": 115.08333333333333,
   "y1": 222.87222222222238,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“How so? how can it affect them?”",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 223.6694444444446,
   "x1": 157.33333333333334,
   "y1": 226.75277777777794,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“My dear Mr. Bennet,” replied his wife, “how can you be so",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 227.55000000000015,
   "x1": 192.0,
   "y1": 230.6333333333335,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "tiresome! You must know that I am thinking of his marrying",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 231.4305555555557,
   "x1": 191.99999999999991,
   "y1": 234.51388888888906,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "one of them.”",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 235.31111111111127,
   "x1": 124.91666666666667,
   "y1": 238.39444444444462,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Is that his design in settling here?”",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 239.19166666666683,
   "x1": 159.25,
   "y1": 242.27500000000018,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Design! nonsense, how can you talk so! But it is very likely",
   "x0": 111.75,
   "y0": 243.0722222222224,
   "x1": 191.99999999999991,
   "y1": 246.15555555555574,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "that he may fall in love with one of them, and therefore you",
   "x0": 107.0,
   "y0": 246.95277777777795,
   "x1": 192.00000000000003,
   "y1": 250.0361111111113,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  }
 ],
 "meta": [
